sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen
    participant Client as Browser / Client (PaymentModal)
    participant PayAPI as Next.js API (/api/payments)
    participant Gateway as Payment Gateway (ePay/UPI)
    participant FSM as FSM Engine (lib/fsm.ts)
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database (Payment/Application)
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Citizen->>Client: Choose payment method and click Pay
    Client->>PayAPI: POST /api/payments { applicationId, method }
    activate PayAPI

    PayAPI->>Prisma: Fetch application and statutory fee
    Prisma-->>PayAPI: Application fee: 1500 INR

    PayAPI->>Prisma: Create Payment record (status: PENDING)
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT INTO Payment
    DB-->>Prisma: Payment record created

    PayAPI->>Gateway: Create checkout session
    Gateway-->>PayAPI: Return session orderId
    PayAPI-->>Client: Return paymentUrl & orderId
    deactivate PayAPI

    Client->>Gateway: Complete payment via UPI / Netbanking
    Gateway-->>Client: Payment success callback with signature

    Client->>PayAPI: POST /api/payments/verify { txnId, signature }
    activate PayAPI

    PayAPI->>Gateway: Verify transaction integrity
    Gateway-->>PayAPI: Signature Valid (SUCCESS)

    PayAPI->>FSM: canTransition("PAYMENT_PENDING", "PAYMENT_COMPLETED")
    FSM-->>PayAPI: Allowed (true)

    PayAPI->>Prisma: $transaction(update payment & application status)
    activate Prisma
    Prisma->>DB: UPDATE Payment SET status=COMPLETED
    Prisma->>DB: UPDATE Application SET status=PAYMENT_COMPLETED
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT ApplicationStatusHistory
    DB-->>Prisma: Transaction committed
    Prisma-->>PayAPI: Updated records
    deactivate Prisma

    PayAPI->>Notify: Send digital payment receipt
    Notify-->>PayAPI: Sent

    PayAPI-->>Client: 200 OK { success: true, receiptUrl }
    deactivate PayAPI

    Client-->>Citizen: Show Payment Receipt & Enable Appointment Booking
